<title>CROATIA: Croatian June output rises 8.4 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Croatian June output rises 8.4 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   JUNE	 MAY	 JUNE '96</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	   n/a	  1.2	  -1.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year		     8.4	  5.2	  -0.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1995)	    110.7	109.1	 102.1</p>
<p>NOTE - June figures are preliminary. January-June output rise was put at 4.7 percent compared to the same year-ago period. Data include estimates for the Serb region of Eastern Slavonia which represents some two percent of the reporting base. The month-on-month figure for June was not available.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb newsroom, + 385 1 455 7075</p>
